# Project Proposal

## Project Name
SafeHer

## Objective
To develop an AI-powered women safety application that provides emergency support through smart technology.

## Goals
- Improve personal safety
- Reduce emergency response time
- Enable instant communication
- Provide intelligent threat detection

## Target Users
- Students
- Working Professionals
- Travelers
- Families

## Expected Outcome
A mobile application capable of sending emergency alerts, sharing live locations, and activating safety measures automatically.
